  "body": "The proof-driven campaign disproves universal fixed-coordinate repair: an admitted decomposable family needs arbitrarily many distinct deviation locations, even though every independent scalar barrier and the separate LEX triple remain (1,1,1). Universal unit barriers and the case without this independent-branch decomposition remain unresolved. No smallest-witness claim.\n\nThe preregistered finite domain is one specified ten-vertex tree, three indexed views, and one target profile. Independent complete enumeration found 279,685 admitted states, 2,304 unit states, 5,580 primitive unit edges, and 36 singleton target components. Of all 630 component pairs, 180 admit a fixed-coordinate unit path and 450 require the deviation location to move. All 630 fail both prior structural sufficient conditions. The named eight-move path is valid and globally shortest.\n\nClosure evidence:\n- Verified integrated parent: 09f3e608e70d8aa70f064ad70909961eaef21bad.\n- Prospective preregistration: 21a06339bf3dfd3c9f488ba77d15fec7aa992e2e, committed directly on that parent before new numerical work.\n- Independently reviewed projection theorem, producer/verifier and execution bindings; review corrections retained in REVIEW.md and EXECUTION.md.\n- Initial run 36778996998 and publication a47fa91596e306a46c7cb0328a986395e051562e preserved in history; later provenance corrections do not relabel known results as predictions.\n- Final source: 3376ce0174edaa688a0f4a1f60ec053a3a0b6841.\n- Final science and fresh publication: run 36779627537, all 300 inherited checks plus 39 new controls passed in EACH phase, with both substantive RED controls retained. Fresh v16.39 canonical replay and all new scientific bytes agree exactly.\n- Downloaded science artifact 11127455639 and publication artifact 11126574519 passed API digest, ZIP CRC, full membership, hash, exact execution source and metadata checks. All 1,350 source/input files match the execution commit; all 102 durable publication members match the published Git tree.\n- Verified publication head bd456dc9a605fad40f6f2138b9d70095193ea898 was marked ready and merged as 1de55a8a1e416062ba05cdb0cdd13cf06fc3dfca.\n\nStatus: MERGED / ACTUAL-MERGE AUDIT IN PROGRESS. Full stage certification is pending the fresh actual-merge run and durable, independently verified receipt.",
